      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on this schema and it's currently in 2NF but it's looking pretty messy with a lot of redundant info. can u walk me through the steps to get it to 3NF? i need to make sure i handle transitive dependencies right.",
      "source": "evaluator"
